@token = paste-keycloak-access-token-here

### Provinces
GET http://localhost:8088/api/provinces
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create taxpayer
POST http://localhost:8088/api/taxpayers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"taxCode":"0101234567","name":"Cong ty Mau","address":"Ha Noi","provinceCode":"HN","phone":"0900000000"}

### Create fine decision
POST http://localhost:8088/api/fines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decisionNumber":"QD-2026-0001","taxpayerCode":"0101234567","violation":"Cham nop ho so thue","provinceCode":"HN","amount":5000000,"issuedDate":"2026-09-24"}

### Payments are created asynchronously from fine.created
GET http://localhost:8088/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
